INSERT INTO `t_ai_chat_message` (`id`, `create_by`, `create_time`, `update_by`, `update_time`, `del_flag`, `session_id`, `role`, `content`) VALUES (490, '1', '2025-09-16 20:01:04', '1', '2025-09-16 20:01:04', 1, 15, 'assistant', '查询执行失败，系统返回了以下错误信息：\n\n```\nStatementCallback; bad SQL grammar [SELECT * FROM t_log WHERE level = \'ERROR\' AND (message LIKE \'%error%\' OR operation LIKE \'%error%\') AND create_time >= \'2025-09-16 00:00:00\' AND del_flag = 0 ORDER BY create_time DESC LIMIT 20]\n```\n\n这可能是由于以下原因之一：\n1. SQL语法错误。\n2. 数据库表结构或字段名称不匹配。\n3. 查询语句存在潜在风险，被系统拦截。\n\n请提供更多的查询条件或尝试简化查询需求，我会尽力协助！');
