INSERT INTO `t_ai_chat_message` (`id`, `create_by`, `create_time`, `update_by`, `update_time`, `del_flag`, `session_id`, `role`, `content`) VALUES (514, '1', '2025-09-16 20:34:33', '1', '2025-09-16 20:34:33', 1, 16, 'assistant', '根据你的查询请求，以下是查询结果：\n\n**查询结果：**\n- **查询意图**：查询今天报错的20条日志\n- **查询条数**：20 条\n- **执行结果**：未找到符合条件的日志记录\n\n**查询统计：**\n- 共找到 **0 条日志记录**。\n\n**执行的 SQL 语句：**\n```sql\nSELECT id as \'日志ID\', level as \'日志级别\', module as \'所属模块\', message as \'日志消息\', class_name as \'类名\', summary as \'接口描述\', path as \'请求路径\', DATE_FORMAT(create_time, \'%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%s\') as \'创建时间\' \nFROM t_log \nWHERE level = \'ERROR\' \n  AND (message LIKE \'%报错%\' OR summary LIKE \'%报错%\' OR class_name LIKE \'%报错%\') \n  AND create_time >= \'2025-09-16 00:00:00\' \n  AND del_flag = 0 \nORDER BY create_time DESC \nLIMIT 20\n```\n\n**提示：**\n如需查看更多详细信息，请使用更具体的筛选条件，例如指定模块、类名或更精确的关键词。😊');
